<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Hebrews</para>
  <para style="toc1">HEBREW Mingei kôma Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrew</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt1">HEBREW</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mingei kôma Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Hebrew mingei kôma lekhamuthuon</char> hi pâl doina arât pe ngei tit sika an khristien taksônna roia, chiomtak tuongngei kôma miziek ani. Amiziekpu hin Jisua Khrista hih Pathien inlangna diktak le mongnatak ani ti minlang pe ngeiin an taksônna lama a mohôk ngei bak ani. Hi a mohôkna hin chongtak inthum lunghâng a tho ani. (1) Jisua hih kumtuong Pathien Nâipasal ania, dûktongna tuongin a Pa chongjômna adika ânchu ani. Pathien Nâipasal ani anghan Jisua chu Chongtung Muruoa dêipungei nêkin ânchung uola, vântîrtonngei le Moses nêkin khom ânchung uol ani. (2) Jisua chu Chongtung Muruoa ochaingei nêka inchung uola kumtuong ochai ni rangin Pathien'n a phuong ani. (3) Jisua jârin a iemngei chu sietnangei china le thina ngei renga sanminringin an om zoia, male Hebrew sakhuo balam taksa sa thisena inbôlnan arlim a lei minlang ngâi hah Jisua chu Ochai Inlaltak ani anghan sanminringna diktak a pêk zoi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Israelngei thurchia mi senkhat riming inthang ngei taksônna (bung 11) ha enminkhinan mangin a miziekpu hin apore ngei hi taksônoma omngâi rangin a ngêna, male (bung 12) hin amongdêna taksônoma omtita Jisua tieng enngitin, i-anga dûktongna le nuomlona an chunga hong tung khom rese tuong rangin a ngên ani. Hi lekhamuthuon hi inningna le rilna chongin akhâr ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmaruoi: Khrista hi Pathien inlangna akipna ani <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Vântîrtonngei nêkin ânchung uol <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4—2:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista chu Moses le Joshua nêkin ânchung uol <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1—4:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista ochai nina ânchung tie <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista chonginkhit ânchung tie <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:28">8:1—9:28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista inbôlna ânchung tie <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 10:1-39">10:1-39</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Taksônna alutna bultak ani tie <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1—12:29</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pathien râiminsâna <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khârna chubai thona <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-21">13:20-21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Azoina chongngei <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:1-25">13:1-25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Pathien'n a Nâipasal renga chong a misîrna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Tienlâi han Pathien'n ei richibulngei kôm a dêipungei mangin zora tamtak le lam tamtakin chong a lei misîr ngâia, <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>aniatachu sûnnûktieng ngeia hin chu ei kôm a Nâipasal mangin thurchi a misîr zoi. Ama taka han Pathien'n vânnuoi hi a sina, ama hah sûn nûktaka chu neinunngei murdi chang let rangin a thang ani zoi. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Ama han Pathien roiinpuina vâra min êla Pathien angna tatak dônin rammuol pumpui ama sinthotheina chongin a minding ani. Miriemngei sietna renga ngâidamna a sin pe suonûkin, Pathien Ânsângtak sinthothei kut changtieng invâna a hon sung zoi.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien Nâipasal roiinpuina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Pathien'n Nâipasal hah vântîrtonngei nêka riming roiinpui uol a lei pêk anghan ama ha vântîrtonngei nêka inlal uola sinin a hong om zoi. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lap 2:7</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Rich 17:13</ref> </char></note> Hi chong hi Pathien'n vântîrtonngei tute kôm ti tet ngâi mak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nangma ka Nâipasal ni ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">aviensûn hin na Pa ko hongni zoi,”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Mapên han Pathien'n tu vântîrton chungroi khom misîrin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Keima hi a Pa nîng ka ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Male ama hah ka Nâipasal nîng a tih,” ti chong hi ti ngâi mak.<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Bal 32:43</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Aniatachu Pathien'n a Nâipasal lutîr hah rammuola a juongtîr rang lâiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Pathien vântîrtonngei murdi'n Ama chubai an mûk ngêt rang ani,” a ti ani.<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Aniatachu vântîrtonngei chungroi chu Pathien'n hi anghin a ti,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Lap 104:4</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Pathien'n a vântîrtonngei mantha a sin ngâia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">male a tîrlâmngei chu meidonin a sin ngâi.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Nâipasal chungroi rêk chu Pathien'n a tia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8,9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:6">Lap 45:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 45:7">7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“O Pathien ne Rêngram chu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">O Pathien ne Rêngram chu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathien chu ne Rêngram ani.</char></note> kumtuong kumtuongin om tit a tih!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Ni mingei chunga satnân roi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ne; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a.</char></note> ne jêk ngâi ani.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Adik ni midita male, adikloi chu nu mumâk ngâi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Masikin Pathien, na Pathien han nang thangin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">na champuingei nêkin miritna le râisâna nang a pêk uol ok zoi ani hi,”<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Lap 102:25-27</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> “Nangma, Pumapa, aphut han pilchung ni sina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">male invânngei khom nu kut ngêtin ni sin ani a ti sa.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Ma ngei hah lân mang an ta, aniatachu nangma chu om tit ni tih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">anni ngei ha chu puonsilngei angin la lîmpai an tih.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Kâncholinchuol anghan la thep ngei na ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">male anni ngei ha pounngei angin la thûl nîng an tih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Aniatachu nangma chu zoratin ni ni ngâiin ni nia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">male ni ringna khom hek tet no nih.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lap 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pathien'n a vântîrtonngei tute kôm hi chong hi ti tet ngâi mak:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Na râlngei ne ke sirpha darnân ka dar mâka chu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">Ka changtieng hin insung roh,” ti hi.<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Nônte, vântîrtonngei hi imo an ni? Anni ngei ha chu ratha, Pathien sintho ngei an nia, sanminringna man rang ngei san ranga ama'n a tîr ngei an ni.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Sanminringna roiinpui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Masikin tuong minmanga ei om loina rangin chongtak ei riet ngei hah ei sûr mindet tit rang ani. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Vântîrtonngeiin ei richibulngei kôma chongbe an lei mintung luo ha adika, tukhom a jômloi le a jûiloi chu dûk an manruo ngei chu an man kelen ngâi ani. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Hima dôra sanminringna roiinpui vang hite lunghâng tho loiin om ila, kho angin mo ênthup thei ranga? Hi sanminringna hi aphut han Pumapa'n a phuonga, masuole ama riet ngeiin adik ani ti min minthâr pe ani. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Ma angdên han Pathien khomin sininkhêl jât dadang le kamâmom neinun sinin le ama lungdoa Ratha Inthieng neinunpêkngei semin ma ngei hah rietpuipu a bôksa ani.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sanminringna tienga mi ruoipu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Pathien'n vântîrtonngei hah rammuol thar la hong om rang ei misîr chunga roijêkpu rangin dar mak. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6-8: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Lap 8:4-6</ref></char></note> Manêkin chu, khomuna mini Pathien Lekhabua lei ti anghan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Miriem hih imo ania, O Pathien, ni mindon tit ngâi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Miriemngei khom hi imo no donsui tit ranga?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Anni hah chomolte rangin vântîrton ngei nêkin ânnuoi uolin ni sina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">roiinpuina le miritnân ni minkhuma,<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>male neinunngei murdi chunga roijêkpu rangin ni sin zoi.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek tamtakin an mokhop: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ne neinun sinngei murdi chunga roijêkpun ni sin ngeia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Lap 8:6 nah en roh).</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Pathien'n miriem, “Neinunngei murdi chunga roijêkpu'n a sin” a ti sikin lam tina ahuom let ti ânthâr. Hannoma, atûn chu neinun murdi chunga roijêk mi la mu mak me. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Aniatachu Jisua, chomolte ranga vântîrton ngei nêka innuoi uola sin hah ei mu ani, Pathien moroina jâra mitin ta ranga thi rangin. Thina a tuongna sika han roiinpuina le miritna inkhumin atûn hin ei mu zoi ani. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Pathien, neinun ngei murdi sinpu le hôipu ta rangin chu, a roiipuina changsa ranga nâingei tamtak a hong tuong theina rangin Jisua hah tuongna sika achukphara sina om le adik ani. Jisua hah sanminringna tienga mingei ruoipu ani sikin.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Ama'n mingei an sietna renga a min thieng ngâi, male ama le a mi inthieng ngei hah an Pa munkhat ani. Masikin Jisua'n ma ngei hah suongsuok ngei tia koi inzakpui mak. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Lap 22:22</ref></char></note> Pathien kôm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Ki mingei kôm ni sintho ngei misîr ka ta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">An intûpna nang minpâk ki tih,” a ti.<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>“Pathiena ka taksônna minngam ki tih,” a ti nôka. Male “Pathien'n nâipang mi pêk ngei leh hin kin om,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17">Isa 8:17</ref> (LXX); <ref loc="ISA 8:18">Isa 8:18</ref></char></note> a ti nôk sa.<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Jisua'n nâipang a koi ngei hah taksa le thisen dôn mi anni sikin ama ngêt khom anni ngei anga juong omin an miriem nina a juon sempui ngei sa ani. Ma hah a juong thona abitak chu thina chunga rachamneipu Diabol hah a minmang theina rang le, <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>ma angdên han athi rang chia damsûnga suoka om murdi ngei hah a sanminjôk theina ranga ani. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>A san ngâi hah vântîrtonngei nimak ngei ti ânthâr. Manêkin, “Abraham suonpârngei a san ngâi.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa 41:8</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 41:9">9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Masika han Pathien sin a thona han miriemngei Ochai Inlaltak, taksônom le lungkhamna sip a hong nia, an sietna ngâidam an ni theina rangin lam tina a sûngsuokngei anghan a om anâng piel ani. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Male ama ngêtin huongna tongin a lei tuong zoi sikin, atûn chu huongna tong ngei a san thei zoi ani.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua chu Moses nêkin aroiinpui uol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Ki khristien sûngsuokngei, Pathien'n a koi ngei! Ei taksônna lama Ochai Inlaltak ni ranga Pathien'n a tîr Jisua hah mindon roi. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Pathien insûngmingei lâia Moses taksôn oma a om anghan ama khom hi sin tho ranga a thangpu Pathien kôm taksôn a om ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Tel 12:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>In sinpu'n a in sin nêkin miritna achang uol anghan Jisua hih Moses nêkin roiinpuina achang uol ok rangin ânhoi ani. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>In tiin hi tu sin mini chu ani ngêta, male neinun murdi chu Pathien sin ani. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Pathien insûngmingei lâia suok chu Moses hah taksôn omtak ania, Pathien'n sûnmotona la ti rang ngei hah a lei misîr ani. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Aniatachu Khrista rêk chu Pathien insûngmingei chunga taksônom le donsûipu Nâipasal ani. Ei hâina sûr mindetin ei sabeina hin ei minngam titin chu a insûngmingei chu eini ngei hih ei ni.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien mingei ta ranga inngamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Lap 95:7-11</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Masika han Ratha Inthiengin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Aviensûn Pathien rôl nin rietin chu,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>nin richibulngei ramchâra Pathien an minsin lâia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">ama doia an inhel anghan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">nin mulung minngar khâi no roi.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Pathien'n, ramchâra han nin richibul ngeiin mi minsin rangin an pûta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">kum sômminli sûnga ki sintho an mu suonûk khomin, a ti.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Masikin ha mingei chunga han ka takasia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Khotiklâi khomin iemomin om ngâi mak ngeia, male Ko chongpêkngei khom jôm ngâi mak ngei.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Ka taksi sikin chonginkhâm ngartak ki sina:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">Ki minngam ngeina rang rama han lût tet noni ngei!” ki tia a ti anghan.<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Ki iempu champui ngei, Pathien ring hah nûksong rangin nin lâia tutên iemloina mulungrîl saloi nin dôn loina rangin indîn roi. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Manêkin, nin lâia tute sietna methêmna sika mulung ngarin nin om loina rangin Pathien Lekhabun “Aviensûn” ti mi mang pe kâr chu anîngtin inkhat le inkhat insan inlôm tit roi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Ei iem phutna ngamna hah among dênin ei sûr mindet ngânin chu Khrista leh munkhata changsa rang ngei ei ni zoi.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7">Lap 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Ma hih Pathien Lekhabu'n ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Aviensûn Pathien rôl nin rietin chu, nin richibulngeiin Pathien doia an inhel lâia anghan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">nin mulung minngar khâi no roi.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Tu miriemngei mo Pathien rôl riet suonûka ânhelngei hah? Egypt ram renga Moses'n a ruoi suok ngei hah an ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Tel 14:1-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Tu ngei chunga mo Pathien'n kum sômminli sûnga a taksi hah? Sietna sina ramchâra athia ânlet ngei chunga han ani. <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Tu ngei mo Pathien'n chonginkhâm ngartak dônin, “Ki minngam ngeina rang rama han lût tet noni ngei,” a ti hah? Ânhelngei murdi hah an ni. <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Ma anghan, an iemloi sikin ma rama han lût thei mak ngei tiin ei mu ani.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Atûn hin Pathien'n ha inngamna roi a misîrna hah ei man theina rangin chonginkhâm mi pêk ani. Masikin nin lâia tute ha inngamna lei khâmna taka lût theiloia nin om loina rangin indîn roi. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Thurchi Sa chu an riet angtakin eini khomin ei riet. Chong chu an rieta, aniatachu an chong riet han ite satna manpui mak ngei, asikchu chong an riet lâi han taksônnân an pom loi sikin ani. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Lap 95:11</ref></char></note> Eini ama iem ngei chu, Pathien'n a chonginkhâm inngamna han ei lût bang ani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Ka taksina sikin chonginkhâm inngartak ki sina:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Inngamna rang ram ke pêk ngeina han lût tet no ni ngei!’” a ti anghan.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">A sintho ngei hah rammuol a sinphut zora a zoisai nikhomrese ha chong hah a la ti ani. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Aph 2:2</ref></char></note> Pathien Lekhabu'n kho muna mini sûnsarini roi, hi anghin a ti: “Pathien'n sûnsarini chu a sintho murdi renga ânngam zoi.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Lap 95:11</ref></char></note> Ma roi zom nanâk hah “Inngamna rang ram ke pêk ngeina han lût tet no ni ngei,” a ti nôk ani. <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Thurchi Sa lei riet masa ngei han iem loina sika an lût thei khâiloi sikin midang ngei la lût rangin phalna a la om ani. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Lap 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Ma anghan, Pathien'n “Aviensûn” tiin nikhuo dang ânkhâm nôk ani. Kum tamtak suonûkin David mangin motona a lei rilsai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Aviensûn Pathien rôl nin rietin chu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">nin mulung minngar khâi no roi,” ti hah a ti nôka.<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Joshua'n mipui ngei hah Pathien chonginkhâm inngamna hah a lei pêk ngei thei nisenla chu, Pathien'n nûka han nikhuo dang roi misîr khâi no nih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Bal 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Jos 22:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Ma angdên han, Pathien mingei ta rangin chu sûn sarinia Pathien'n a sintho renga ânngam anghan inngamna hah a la om tit ani. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Tukhom Pathien chonginkhâm inngamna taka lût chu Pathien'n a sintho renga ânngam anghan ama khom a sintho renga inngamna man a tih. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Aph 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Tho, masikin anni ngei angin taksôn loina sika chukloia om loiin inngamna hah ei chang theina rangin ranak song ei tih u.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Pathien chong chu aringa, sin a tho theia, khandai beniknei ngaidak nêkin khom angai uol ani. Ringna le ratha inchunna ngei, rolo le rithingngei dênin a sunkhoi theia. Miriem mulungrîla ôina le mindona khom a riet let ngâi ani. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Pathien renga chu neinun ite ânthup thei ommak; neinunsin ngei murdi khom a mitmua chu ânlârphangin an ong-iem ani. Male ama kôm han ei sika ei thurchi chit ei la misîr let ngêt rang ani.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Ochai Inlal Roiinpuitak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Pathien omna lele invâna lei sesai, Ochai Inlal roiinpuitak Jisua, Pathien Nâipasal hah ei dôn sikin ei taksônna hi sûr mindet tit ei ti u. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Ochai Inlaltak ei dôn hih ei râtloina mi rietpui phâkloi ni maka, eini anghan lam tina huongna tong sai ani, aniatachu, sietna chu tho loi mi ei dôn ani. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Tho, masika han lungkhamna jâra moroina le sanna ei nâng tika ei man theina rangin Pathien moroina rêngsukmun hah hâitakin pan ei ti u.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Ochai Inlaltak ngei ngân chu sietnangei sika inbôlna le neinunpêkngei pêk ranga miriemngei ruthûla Pathien sintho ranga a miriem champuingei renga thangin phun an ni. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Ma ngei khom hah lam tamtaka an râtloina sikin, ite rietloi ngei le an sietnangei chunga han an phûk ânuoi thei ngâi ani. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Male ha an râtloina sika han sietnangei sika inbôlna hah mingei ta rang vaia pêk loiin anni ngei ta rang khom an pêk sa anâng ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Och 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Miritna chang rang nuomin tute atheiin ochai inlaltak chang thei ngâi mak ngei. <char style="w">Aaron</char> anga Pathien koi ngei vai kêng ochai inlaltak an chang thei ngâi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Jôk 28:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lap 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ma angdên han, Khrista khomin ochai inlaltak ani sika miritna hah ama ta rangin lâk mak. Manêkin, Pathien'n a kôm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Nangma ka Nâipasal ni ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">aviensûn hin na Pa ko hongni zoi,” a ti ani.<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Lap 110:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Mun danga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Nangma chu Melchizedek angin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">kumtuongin ochai nîng ni tih,” a ti sa.<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref></char>
    </note> Pilchunga a ring lâi han Jisua'n thina renga ama sanminring theipu Pathien kôm inringtaka iniekin le mitrithi tâk pumin chubaithona le ngêna a neia. Rangâichîn taka ân pêkna sikin Pathien'n a rangâi pe ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Aniatachu Pathien Nâipasal tatak nikhomsenla a tuongna ngeia han chongjômna ânchu ani. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Achukphar a hongni tena chu a chongjôm ngei ta rangin kumtuong sanminringna nâr a hongni zoi. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>male Pathien'n Melchizedek <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Melchizedek </char><char style="ft" closed="false">... </char><char style="fq" closed="false">angin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(5:6 en roh).</char></note> angin kumtuong ochai inlaltak ni rangin a phuong zoi.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taksônna mâk loina ranga inningna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Ma chungroia hin misîr rang tamtak ei dôn, aniatachu a misîr minthâr ântak nin rietthei loi sikin. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12,13: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1 Kor 3:2</ref></char></note> Azora mindonin chu minchupu nithei rak ta ungla ânhoia, hannirese Pathien chongbul tak la minchu nin nâng nôk zoi ani. Burum nêk nêkin runutui nêk kêng nin la nâng rêk. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Tukhom runutui nêk a la nâng chu nâipang, adik le adikloi ite la riet loi ani. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Burum rêk chu ulienngei an thôn zong sika asalesie sensâi thei ngei ta rang ani.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Tho, masikin Khristien chongbul misîr khâiloiin moton tieng sên, mitungsuo minchuna lam pan ei ti u. Sin kâmnângloi ngei le thina mintung ngâi renga inheia Pathien iem rang tie ngei, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>baptisma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">baptisma; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">minthiengna sinngei.</char></note> le kut minngamna chungroia minchuna ngei; thina renga inthoinôkna roi le kumtuong roijêkna ngei lungphûm chu phûm nôk khâi no u. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Tho, moton tieng pan ei tih u! Male Pathien'n mi phal pea anin chu mahah ei tho rang ani.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Kho angin mo an taksônna mâka om ngei hah an honsîr thei nôk rang? Voikhat chu Pathien vâra oma; invân neinunpêk temsai le Ratha Inthieng khom changsaia; <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>Pathien chong asa tie le zora la hong om ranga sinthotheina om rang ngei khom riet saia. <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>Male an taksônna amâk nôk ngei chu! insîr nôka hongkîr nôk theiruo ni khâi mak ngei. Anni ngei han Pathien Nâipasal hah jêmdel nôkin mâimôk anshak sikin.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Pil, a chunga ruotui tâk ngâi lei methêpa, a sin ngei ta ranga chimu kâmom musuo pe chu Pathien'n sat a vur ngâi. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Aniatachu ma pil han rilingngei le chiekngei a mônga nîn chu maha kâmnângloi ania; Pathien khomâksâm chi omtakin a oma, male nûka chu meia hâl minmangin om atih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17">Aph 3:17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:18">18</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Hannirese, ruol moroi om ngei, ma anghan ti khom unglang, nangni chu satvurna sa uol sanminringna nin dôn ti kin riet minthâr ani. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Pathien chu adikloi nimak. Ama ta ranga sin nin tho ngei, lungkhamna nin minlang ngei, nin khristien champui ngei nin lei san ngei le atûntena khom nin la san tit ngei hah mingil tet no nih. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Nin sabei a hong tung dik theina rangin nin sika nin takintâina hah amongna tena nin musuo chit rangin kin nuom tatak ani. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Nin ratha minboi loiin, iemna le tuongdierna sika Pathien chonginkhâm a man ngei om anghan nin hong om rangin kin nuom ani.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien chonginkhâm adik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Pathien'n Abraham kôm chonginkhâm a sin lâihan ama nêka roiinpui uol tute an omloi sikin ama riming sâmin khomâk ânsâma. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16">Aph 22:16</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:17">17</ref></char></note> A kôm, “Sat nang vur ka ta male suonpâr tamtak nang pêk ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Abraham a tuongdier sikin Pathien chonginkhâm hah a man ani. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Miriemngeiin khomâk an insâmin anni nêka roiinpui uol ngei riming sâmin khomâk an insâma, an inkhalna murdi khom an mong ngâi. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Pathien'n a chonginkhâm man rang ngei kôm han a neinun khîn thûl tet no nih; ti minthâr pe ngei uol nuomin a chonginkhâm hah khomâk insâmin a mindet ani. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Masikin Pathien'n neinun inik a chonginkhâma thûl theiloi le milak tholoi rang mangin eini a kôma jôkna man ngei hin ei motona sabeina om hih sûr mindet tit rangin mi mohôk tatak ani. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Och 16:2</ref></char></note> Ma sabeina hah ei ringnun rangin thirkuoirikit anghan ani. Maha adet tak le ânthârlak ania, invân biekin puondûng sunga mun inthienga khom a lûta. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Mahan Jisua'n ei ruthûlin ei motona a lei lût zoia, male Melchizedek <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Melchizedek </char><char style="ft" closed="false">... </char><char style="fq" closed="false">angin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(en roh 5:6).</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Lap 110:4</ref></char></note> angin kumtuong ochai inlaltak a lei hongni zoi.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ochai Melchizedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1,2: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Aph 14:17-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Hi Melchizedek hi Salem rêng le Pathien Inchungtak ochai ani. Abraham'n rêng minli ngei a mene suole râlbuol renga a hong tieng Melchizedek han ân tongpuia, sat a vura, <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>male Abraham'n a lâk ngei murdi sômakhat a pêk zoi. (Melchizedek riming omtie motontak chu, “Dikna Rêng” ania, male Salem rêng ani sikin “Inngêina Rêng,” khom ani sa.) <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Melchizedek pa mo, nu mo, ani nônchu a richibulngei mo, ânziekna reng om mak; a suokna le a thina khom ânziekna khom om sa mak. Ama chu Pathien Nâipasal anghan; kumtuong ochaiin a om bang ani.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>En ta u, khodôra roiinpui mo ani. Ei richibul inthangtak Abraham luon a râllâk neinunngei murdi sômakhat a pêk hah. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Tel 18:21</ref></char></note> Male Levi richisuonpârngei lâia ochai chang ngei hah Israelngei kôm renga sômakhat rusuong rangin Balamin chong a pêk ani, ma hah an ramsungmingei nanâk kôm renga ani, an ram mingei hah Abraham richisuonpâr ngei nanâk nikhomrese ngeia. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Melchizedek hah Levi richisuonpâr renga chu ni maka, aniatachu Abraham kôm renga sômakhat a rusuonga, Pathien chonginkhâm manpu hah sat a vur ani. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Ti nâng loiin satvura ompu nêkin a vurpu chu a roiinpui uol ani. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Ochaingei chungroia chu athi thei miriem ngeiin sômakhat an rusuonga; aniatachu Melchizedek rangin chu Pathien lekhabu'n, aring titin sômakhat a rusuong ati ani. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Male, Abraham'n sômakhat a pêk lâihan, Levi (a richisuonpârngei sômakhat rusuong ngâipu) khom a pêk sa ti thei ani. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Melchizedek'n Abraham ân tongpui lâihan Levi hah la suok maka, aniatachu a richibul Abraham takpum sûnga a om zoi ani.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Israel mingei kôm han levirûi ochai nina nuoia Balam pêk ani. Atûn, ha ngei sintho hah achukphar aninte, <char style="w">Aaron</char> anga niloiin Melchizedek anga ochai dang hon lang rang ite anângna omak. <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Asikchu Ochai nina hah ahôn thûlin chu balam khom a hon thûl rang anâng ngâi ani. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Male hi neinunngei misîra om ei Pumapa chu nam dang ania, a jâtngei lâia tute ochai chang ngâi mak ngei. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Ei Pumapa chu Juda nam renga inzir ani ti riet minthâr ani; male Moses'n Ochaingei chungroi a misîr lâihan hi nam hih dênphâk mak.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Melchizedek anga Ochai dang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Ei roi misîr hah ahon thâr uol zoi; Melchizedek anga ochai dang ahong inlang zoi. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Ama hah miriem balama sin ni loiin mong ngâiloi ringna sinthotheinân ochaia sin ani. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Pathien Lekhabun, “Melchizedek anghan nangma kumtuong ochai nîng ni tih,” a ti angin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Melchizedek </char><char style="ft" closed="false">... </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anghan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(5:6 nah en roh).</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Lap 110:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Balam muruo hah râtloi le amangnaboi ani sikin khâipai ani zoi. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Moses Balam han ite achukpharin a sin thei khâiloi sikin. Male atûn chu sabeina sa uol pêkin ei om renga, Pathien ei nâi thei zoi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Maruolin, Pathien inkhâmna khom a om sa zoia, midang ngei ochai an chang lâihan chu hi anga inkhâmna hih om ngâi mak. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Aniatachu, Jisua chu Pathien'n a kôm:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Lap 110:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Pumapa hah khomâk insâmin chonginkhâm a sina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">male lâk mikhîr khâi no nih;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Nangma kumtuongin ochai nîng ni tih,’” tiin khomâk insâmin ochaiin a sin ani.<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Hanchu ha atei uolna han Jisua chu chonginkhit sa uol inkhâmpûn a sin zoi ani.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Atei uolna dang a la om sa: midang ngei ha chu thina sikin an sintho ngei hah an zomtit thei loi sikin ochaia sin hah mi tamtak an ni. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Aniatachu Jisua chu kumtuongin a ring tit sikin a ochai sin hah tutên thûl mak ngei ani. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Masikin ama taka Pathien kôma hong ngei chu atûn le khotiklâi khomin a sanminring thei, anni ngei ta ranga Pathien kôm ngên pe ngei rangin tuonsôtin a ring tit sikin.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Hanchu Jisua hah Ochai Inlaltak ei nângngei murdi minchukpu ani. Ama chu ânthienga, minchâinaboi, sietna dônloi, misiengei lâi renga athei piela om, invânngei nêka ânchung uolpu ani. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Ama chu ochai inlal dang ngei anghan ni maka; ama rangin chu anîngtin a sietna inbôlna pêk bak rang nâng maka, masuole midang ngei sietna rang khom nâng mak. Ama voikhat ânpêk lâihan, voikhat rengin inbôlna inkhatin anrêngin ânzoi let ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Och 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Moses Balam han miriem achukpharloi ngei ochai inlalin a phun ngâia; aniatachu Pathien inkhâmna chonginkhâm, Balam nûka juong om han chu Nâipasal hah, kumtuonga achukphara a phun ani.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua ei Ochai Inlaltak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Ei misîr lâia abipuitak chu mahi ani, Ochai Inlaltak invâna Rêng Inchungtak rêngsukmun changtienga hong insung ei dôn ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lap 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Miriem kutsin niloi, Pumapa sin puon-in tatak Mun Inthieng taka Ochai Inlaltak angin sin a tho ani.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Ochai Inlaltak ngei murdi'n neinunpêk le sa inbôlna Pathien kôma pêk rangin phun an nia, Masikin ei Ochai Inlaltak khom hin imini chu pêk rang a dôn ngêt rang anâng ani. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Ama hah pilchunga om senla chu, ama chu ochai reng ni tet no nih, Juda Balama neinunpêk anâng ngei pêk ngâi ochaingei an om sikin. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Ochaingei sintho ngâi hah chu invâna neinunngei rimil le rilîm tatak vaike ani. Moses'n Chonginkhitna Puon-in a sin rang lâia phuozekin Pathien'n a kôm, “Ni sin rang tie chu muola a rimil min mua no om ngei angtakin sin rangin mindon roh,” tia a ril anghan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Jôk 25:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Aniatachu, atûn chu, anni ngei nêka ânchung uol ochai sin hah Jisua pêkin a om zoi, Pathien le a mingei kâra chonginkhit a minsûk hah asa uola, ma chonginkhâm hah neinun asa uol ngeia minding ani sikin.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Chonginkhitna masa hah dikloina om no senla chu, a inik changna hah hong om rang nâng no nih. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Aniatachu Pathien'n a mingei dikloina a man lâihan a tia, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Nikhuo ngei ahongtung rang ani zoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">Israel mingei le Juda mingei chonginkhitna athar ki sin pe ngei rang nikhuo ngei hah, Pumapa'n a ti.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>An richibulngei Egypt renga hong tuong ngei ranga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">an kuta ku sûr nia Chonginkhit ki sin anghan chu ni khâi no nih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Anni ngei leh Chonginkhit ki sina han taksôn omin om mak ngeia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">masikin anni ngei hah lunghâng tho ngei khâi mu-ung ani.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Atûn, nikhuo hong tung rang ngeia Israel mingei leh chonginkhit ki sin rang chu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">mahih ani, Pumapa'n a tia:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">An mulungsûnga ka balam ngei dar ka ta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">male an mulungrîl ngeia miziek sâng ki tih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Keima an Pathien nîng ka ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">male anni ngei hah ki mingei nîng an tih.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Tutên, ‘Pumapa hah riet roh,’ tiin an miriem champui mini aninônchu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">an ramsûng miriem champui minîn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">an minchu ngei nâng khâi noni ngei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">Achîntak renga alientak tena min riet let rang anni zoi sikin.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>An sietnangei ngâidam ka ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">an minchâina ngei riettit khâi no ning.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Chonginkhit thar a ti sikin, Pathien'n amotona ha chu a muruon a sin zoi; male neinuntin amuruo hong changa mangsaloi ngei chu inmang lai atih zoi.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Pilchung le invân chubaimûkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Chonginkhit masa khom chubaimûkna balamngei le miriem sin chubaimûkna mun a lei dôn ani. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Puon-in an sina, khâltan pêninta hah Mun Inthieng an tia. Ma sûnga han meiserdarna le dosâng leh Pathiena an pêksai vâipôlngei hah an oma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">Jôk 26:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">25:31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Jôk 25:23-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Puondûng inikna nûktieng han Mun Inthiengtak an ti hah aom.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Jôk 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Jôk 30:1-6</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">Jôk 25:10-16</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:33">Jôk 16:33</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Tel 17:8-10</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:16">Jôk 25:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Bal 10:3-5</ref></char></note> Asûnga han mirimhoi hâlna mun rângkachak mâichâm le rângkachaka minluon Chonginkhit sumduk a oma, Ma sûnga han “Manna” omna rângkachak sungkola ngei, <char style="w">Aaron</char> sunrol abuo hôn cher ngei le chongpêkngei a chunga ânziek lungpêk inik ngei hah an om. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Ma sumduk chunga han Pathien roiinpuina minlangin iringparân mantha dôn ngei hah sietnangei ngâidamna muna an mantha pharin an om sa. Aniatachu, atûn chu ma thurchi ha chu akip akôiin rilsensâi zora la ni mak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Jôk 25:18-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Tel 18:2-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ha neinunngei hah hi anghin an lei minsûk ani. Ochai ngei hah anîngtin apêninta puon-in sûng han an sintum sin rangin an se ngâia, <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>aniatachu asûnginta Puon-in han chu Ochai Inlaltak vai kêng akuma voikhat thisen chôi ngêtin a lût ngâi. Ma thisen a chôi hah ama rang le mipui ngeiin an riet loi kâra sietna an sinngei ruthûlin Pathien kôm an pêk ngâi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Och 16:2-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Hi minsûkna ngei murdi renga hin Ratha Inthiengin ânthârtakin a minchu ngâia; apêninta Puon-in hah a la omsûng kâr chu Mun Inthiengtak lampui hah lân ong mak. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Maha atûnlâi mintêkna ani. Aomtie chu neinunpêkngei le sa inbôlnangei Pathien kôma pêk han a biekpu ngei mulungrîl min chukphar thei maka, <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>sâk rang, nêk rang le minthieng-minthârna balam tamtak roi ngei vai ani sikin. Mangei murdi hah pêntienga balam korong an nia, Pathien'n chongpêk athar a pêk mâka mang rang ani.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Aniatachu Khrista chu neinun sa ngei hi taka lei omsai piel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">omsai piel; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhat ngei chu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ajuonglâitak </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn.</char></note> Ochai Inlaltakin a juong ani. Puon-ina sin a thona ngâi ha a roiinpui uol le achukphara; miriem sin puon-in nimak, ma hih rammuola sinngei lâia nimak tina ani. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Khrista hah Mun Inthiengtaka voikhatin a lûtpat lâihan, inbôlna rangin kêlngei le sielngei thisen chôi maka, ama thisen nanâk chôiin eita rangin kumtuong sanminringna a man zoi ani. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15">Och 16:15</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 16:16">16</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:9">Tel 19:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note> Kêlngei le sechalngei le setuoi ngei hâlminvâmin mi innim chunga an rethe luon an taksa innimna a minsâi pe ngei theia a minthieng thei ngeiin te, <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Khrista thisen vangin te athei uol ok rang na! Kumtuong Ratha ruoinân Pathien kôm ama nanâkin inbôlna achukpharin ânpêk zoi sikin, Pathien ring sin ei tho theina rangin a thisenin thina mintung ngâi ngei sin renga ei sielesarietna minthieng a tih.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Hi sika hin Khrista hih chonginkhit athar minsûkpu ani, Pathien'n a koi ngei hah kumtuong satvurna ânkhâm an man theina ranga ani. Maha anitheina chu chonginkhit masa a la om sûnga miriemngei minchâina renga kelsuoa, thina a lei omsai sikin ani.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Chongmâk roi chu a mâkpu hah athi le thiloi enmindik bak anâng, <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>chongmâkpu a la ringsûngin chu ite amangna la om loiin a thi suonûkin kêng amangna a la om ngâi. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Ma sika han chonginkhit masa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">chonginkhit: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greeka “chongmâk” le “chonginkhit”.</char></note> khom hah thisen an mang tena kêng mang a la chang ani. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Amotona Moses'n Balam Chongpêkngei hah mipui ngei kôm a phuong baka. Masuole chu sechalngei le kêlngei thisen hah tui leh minpolin, hyssop machang le samul sen mangin Balam Lekhabu le mipui ngei murdi hah a thika.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Jôk 24:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>An kôm, “Mahi Pathien'n nin jôm ranga nangni a pêk Chonginkhit nammindetpu thisen hah ani” a tia. <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Ma angdên han Moses'n Puon-in Inthieng le biekna mangruongei murdi khom hah thisen a thik sa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Och 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Och 17:11</ref></char></note>Adiktakin, Balam dungjûiin neinunngei murdi hih thisenin a minthieng thei leta, male sietnangei chu thisen suok vaiin kêng ngâidam ani thei.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista inbôlnân sietnangei a lâkpai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Ma neinunngei, invâna a taktaka a om rimilngei hah ma anghan minthieng an ni rang ani. Aniatachu invâna neinunngei ha chu inbôlna sa uol ok an nâng ani. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Asikchu Khrista chu miriem sin Mun Inthieng atak rimila han lût mak. Atûna Pathien makunga ei ruthûla ân dingna invân khin a lût kelen ani. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Juda Ochai Inlaltak han sa thisen chôiin Mun Inthiengtak han kumtin a se ngâia. Aniatachu Khrista chu ama nanâk inpêk rangin voi tamtak lût maka, <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>ma anghan nino senla chu rammuol sinphut renga voi tamtak a tuong rang ani zoi. Manêkin, atûn zora mong rangtoa hin ânbôlna sika sietna a minhek theina rangin voikhatin a juon lang ani. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Mitin voikhat chu thi ngêt an ta, masuole Pathien'n an chungroi jêkin om an tih. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Ma angdên han Khrista khom ha mi tamtakngei sietna min hek rangin voikhat inbôlnân pêk ani zoi. Sietna min hek rang ni khâi loiin ama lei ngakngei sanminring rangin avoi niknân juon lang nôk atih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Juda Balam hah neinunngei atak phuozek dûr akip le taksônom nimaka; neinun sa juon lang rang rimil minenna vai kêng ani. Kumtin inbôlna ngâi deden hah kumtuongin an pêk ngâi ani. Kho angin mo Balam han ma anga inbôlna ngei sika han Pathien kôma hong mingei hah achukpharin asin thei ranga? <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Pathien chubaimûk ngei hah an sietnangei renga a minthieng ngei tatak nisenla chu, sietnân theiloi an intum bangin inriet khâi noni ngeia, male inbôlna ngei hah inngam atih zoi. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Ma anghan, nikhomrese ma inbôlna han kumtin mingei an sietna a min rietsuok nôk ngei ngâi ani. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Sechalngei le kêlngei thisenin sietnangei hah alâk pai thei tet loi sikin.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Lap 40:6-8</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Ma siktak han, Khrista'n rammuola a juong rang lâihan Pathien kôm:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Nangman inbôlna ngei le neinunpêkngei nuom mak chea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">Keima rangin takpum mi ni minsûk pe zoi.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Mâichâm chunga sa pumpui hâlminvâmngei le sietnangei lâk pai ranga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">inbôlna ngei hah na râiminsân tet mak che.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Male Keiman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">‘O Pathien, Balam lekhabua ku thurchi mizieka lei om anghan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">nu lungdo sin rangin hin ko om,’” ki tia.<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Motontaka ama'n, “mâichâm chunga inbôlna ngei le neinunpêkngei aninônchu sa pum hâlminvâmngei le sietnangei lâk paina ranga inbôlna ngei hah nuom khom nuom mak che, na râi khom minsân mak che a tia.” Hima inbôlna ngei murdi hih Balam dungjûiin pêk nikhomsenla ma anghin a ti ani. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Hanchu, “O Pathien, nu lungdo sin rangin keima hin ko om,” a tia. Masikin Pathien'n inbôlna muruo ngei hah a min hekleta, mangei ruthûla han Khrista inbôlna hi a dar zoi ani. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Jisua Khrista'n Pathien lungdo a sina, ama takpum ngêt hah voikhatin anrênga rangin ânpêk phar sikin ei rêngin sietna renga ênthieng zoi ani.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Juda ochai tinin nîngtin an sintum sinin inbôlna ngâi dedên hah voi tamtak an pêk ngâia; aniatachu ma inbôlna ngei han sietnangei lâk pai thei tet mak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Jôk 29:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Nikhomrese, Khrista chu sietnangei inbôlna rangin voikhat ânpêka, maha kumtuonga omtit rang ani zoia, masuole chu Pathien kut changtieng a hon sung zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lap 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Atûn chu Pathien'n a râlngei a kepha nuoia a dar pe mâka chu mahan a ngâk tit ani. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Hanchu, voikhat inbôlna leh an sietna minthienga omngei ha chu kumtuonga rangin achukpharin a sin ngei zoi.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Hanchu Ratha Inthieng khomin ama rietpuipu mi pêk sa. Amotona,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer 31:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Nikhuo hong tung ranga anni ngei leh chonginkhit ki sin rang chu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">mahi ani, Pumapa'n a ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">An mulung sûnga ka balamngei dar ka ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">male an mulungrîla miziek ki tih.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Masuole chu, “An sietnangei le an tho minchâina ngei riettit khâi no ning,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer 31:34</ref></char></note>a tia. <verse eid="HEB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Masikin ma anga ngâidamna omna taka han chu sietnangei min boina rangin neinunpêk nâng khâi no nih.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien nâi ei ti u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Hanchu, ka lâibungngei le ka sarnungei, Jisua thina sikin Mun Inthiengtaka han phukdâiriemin ei lût thei zoi ani. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Ama'n puondûng (a takpum) renga lam thar le lam ring ei ta rangin mi mo-ong pe zoi. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Pathien insûng donsûipu ochai roiinpuitak ei dôn ani. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Masikin mulungrîl indîn le taksônna adiktak dônin, sie le sa rietna dikloi renga ei mulungrîlngei minthiengin le ei takpumngei tui inthieng leh minsaîin Pathien nâi ei ti u. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Och 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezek 36:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Ei sabeina phuong hih sûr mindet tit ei ti u, Pathien chu a chonginkhâma taksôn aom sikin. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Inkhat le inkhat inlungkhamna minlang inlômin, inkhat le inkhat insan inlômin, sin sa inthope inlôm rangin mindon pak ei ti u. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Mi senkhatngei an thônzong anghan ei intûp inkhom mâk no u. Manêkin Pumapa Nikhuo hah ahong nâi uolin nin mûn chu inkhat le inkhat inmohôk inlôm u-uol ei ti u.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Chongtak ei riet suonûkin nunsie ei la tho bangin chu nunsie ngei lâk pai nôkna rangin inbôlna om khâi no nih. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa 26:11</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Manêkin, aom rang chu chi puma Roijêkna le mei inthang Pathien doi ngei kâng inmangna rang ngâkna vai kêng ani zoi! <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Tukhom Moses Balam jômloi chu, ama theiloi nina rangin rietpuipu inik mini, inthum mini an omin chu moroina boiriekin that ani ngâia. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Bal 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Pathien Nâipasal mumâka, Pathien chonginkhitna thisen ama minthiengna neinun itea be loia, moroina Ratha êro mi hah khodôra dûkmintongna sietuol mo tuong rangin nin minhoi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Jôk 24:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>“Phuba chu keiman lâk ka ta, Keiman thuon ki tih” a tipu le “Pumapa'n a mingei roijêk a tih,” ti hah ei riet sa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Bal 32:35</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 32:36">36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Pathien ring kuta chul chu neinun chi omtak ani!<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Zora vunsaia kho angin mo neinun nin chunga hong om ngei hah riettit roi. Pathien vârin nangni a êl suonûkin ma sûnngei han dûk tamtak nin tuonga, hannoma injêlna han nangni mene mak. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Zora khat chu mipui makunga nangni erôn an nuom nangni an loa, zora danga chu ma anga an lei mintuongei leh munkhatin nin tuonga. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Mi intângngei tuongna hah nin tuongpuia, male nin neinun dôn murdi nangni an sûr pe lâi khom han, kumtuonga sôi rang neinun sa uol nin la dôn ti nin rietin ma nin machânna khom hah râisântakin nin tuong ani. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Râisânman roiinpuitak a mintung rang sikin nin hâina hah minmang no roi. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Pathien lungdo nin sina, a chonginkhâmngei hah nin man theina rangin dierna nin nâng ani. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37,38: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 2:3">Heb 2:3</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 2:4">4</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Pathien Lekhabu'n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Chomolte suole chu, a juong rangpu hah juong a tih zoi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">ama hah innu no nih.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Hannirese, ki midik chu iem a ta male ring a tih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">aniatachu an lâia tu mini nûktieng an tolin chu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">a chunga ka râisân no nih,” a ti anghan.<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Eini chu nûktieng ântola ânmang rang mi nimak me. Manêkin, taksônna dôna sanminring ni rang mi kêng ei ni.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Taksônna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Taksônna dôn ti chu neinunngei ei sabei ngei hah adik ngêt ti le neinun ei mu theiloi ngei a om ngêt ti minthâr hih ani. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>An taksônna jârin kêng zora muruoa mingei han Pathien pomna an lei chang ngâi.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:1">Aph 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Lap 33:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JON 1:3">Jon 1:3</ref></char>
    </note> Taksônna jârin kêng vânnuoi hih Pathien chonga sin ani ti ei riet, masikin neinun ei mu thei ngei hih neinun mu theiloi renga sin an ni.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Taksônnân kêng Abel han Cain nêka inbôlna sa uol Pathien kôm a pêka. A taksônna sikin a neinunpêk hah pomin aoma, midik tiin Pathien pomna a chang ani. A taksônna jârin Abel hah a thi suonûk khomin thurchi a la misîr bang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Aph 4:3-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Taksônnân Enoch hah thiloiin dar ani. Manêkin, ama chu Pathien kôm chungtieng tuongin a oma, Pathien'n ama hah chungtieng a tuong zoi sikin tutên mu khâi mak ngei. Pathien Lekhabu'n Enoch hah chungtieng tuonga aom mân han Pathien râi a lei minsân ngâi, ati ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Aph 5:21-24</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Taksônna boiin chu tutên Pathien râiminsân thei ngâi mak ngei, Tukhom Pathien kôma hong kai chu Pathien aom ngêt ti takansôna male ama rokpu ngei kôm han râisânman a pêk ngâi.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Taksônnân kêng Noah han sûn motona a la mu ngâiloi neinunngei Pathien'n inningna a ril lâihan, Pathien chong jômin rukuong a sina, ama leh a insûngmingei sanminringin an oma. Ma sika han rammuol hah theiloi a minchanga, taksônna sika dikna Pathien kôma om hah a man ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Aph 6:13-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Taksônnân Abraham han, Pathien'n pêk ranga ram a khâm pe muna se rangin a koi lâihan Pathien chong jômin a sena rang luo riet loiin a ram mâkin a se ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Aph 12:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Taksônna jârin Pathien'n ram pêk ranga ânkhâm pena han ramdangmi angin a oma, Pathien renga chonginkhâm mansai Isaac le Jacob anghan puon-inngei han a om ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Aph 35:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Abraham'n khopuilien lungphûm adet, Pathien minvo le sin, khopui hah a ngâk bang ani.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Taksônnân Abraham hah atar ok suonûkin le Sarah khom aching nâi dôn thei khâiloi rang nikhomsenla, Pathien chu a chonginkhâma taksôn aom sikin pa a la chang ani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11:11: </char> miziek senkhata chu <char style="fqa" closed="false">Sarah hah nâinei rangin atar ok khomin taksônna sikin nâi a la vong ani</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Aph 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Abraham hah athi angdôra om nikhomsenla, ma mi inkhat renga han richisuonpâr tamtak, invâna ârsi ngei dôr, tuipui kôla sietsai telsuoloidôr an inzir ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Aph 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Taksônna dônin ha mingei murdi hah an thi ani. Pathien'n a khâm pe neinunngei man phâk khom no rese ngeia, ala tak renga mûn an lei phâma, pilchunga hin ramdangmi ngei le mi invâingei an ni tiin ânlangiemin an lên riet zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Aph 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1 Rich 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Lap 39:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Ma anga neinun ti ngei ha chu an ram an thîr ani ti ânthâr ani. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>An ram hong mâk ha chu mindon tit khâi mak ngeia; mindon senla ngei chu kîrnôkna Zorânchum dôn an tih. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Manêkin, ram sa uol invâna ram om hah kêng an rangâi ani. Masikin Pathien'n an Pathien ânti hah inzak maka, anta rangin khopuilien tena a lei mintuo pe ngei zoi.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Taksônnân Abraham hah Pathien'n a minsin lâihan a nâipasal Isaac hah inbôlnân a pêk ani. Abraham hah Pathien'n a kôm chonginkhâm a sinpuipu nikhomsenla, a nâipasal inkhat mamang khom nirse inbôlna rangin a la pêk nuom ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Aph 22:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>Pathien'n a kôm, “Isaac renga hin ni richisuonpârngei kên khâmngei hah nei ni tih,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Aph 21:12</ref></char></note> a tipe. <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Abraham han, Pathien'n Isaac hah thina renga khom a kaithoi thei ti a rieta, masikin Isaac hah Abraham'n thina renga a man nôk ti rangin a om ani.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Taksônnân Isaac han sûnmotona rangin Jacob le Esau hah chongkhâmin sat a vur ngei ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Aph 27:27-29</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 27:39">27:39</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:40">40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Taksônnân Jakob han a thi rang totôn Joseph nâingei hah sat a vur ngei ruruoia. A sunrol mong chunga inngamin Pathien chubai a muk ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:1-20">Aph 48:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 47:31">Aph 47:31</ref> (LXX)</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Taksônnân Joseph a thi rang lâihan Israelnâi ngei Egypt ram renga an inphêt rang roi a misîra, male a ruok an dar rang chang rilna chong a mâk pe ngei ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24">Aph 50:24</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 50:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Jôk 13:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Taksônnân Moses hah a suok lâihan, nâipang mêlsa takin an mu sikin a nulepan rêng chongpêk donloi hah chi loiin thânthum an thup ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Jôk 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:22">Jôk 1:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Taksônnân Moses han a honglien tena chu, rêng (Pharoah) nâinupang a nâipasal inti rang hah nuom khâi maka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Jôk 2:10-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Chomolte sûnga sietna le hoinân, mang nêkin Pathien mingei leh dûktongna tuong rang a thang uol zoi ani. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Messiah sika mumâkna tuong hah Egypt rama rochon murdi ngei nêka rochon lût uolin a bea, sûn motona râisânman a man rang hah a mitin a thîr tit sikin.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Taksônnân Moses hah rêng taksi hah chi loiin Egypt ram a mâka. Mutheiloi Pathien hah a mu sikin nûkkîr tho rang nuom khâi mak. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Taksônnân Kalkân Kût a minsûka, male thisen hah inkhâr luchunga rethe rangin chong a pêka, masikin Thina Vântîrton han Israelngei nâipasal lutir ngei a that loina rangin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Jôk 12:21-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Taksônnân Israelngei han tâng châra lôn angin Tuipui Sen hah an rakân theia; Egypt mingei chu rakân rang an tho lâihan tuiin a melem ngei let ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Jôk 14:21-31</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Taksônnân kêng Jericho kulpui hah Israelngeiin sûn sari anhîl suolechu achim zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Jos 6:12-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Taksônnân kêng Rahab notizuornu hah Pathien chong jômloi ngei leh thata an om rang renga an jôka, Israel enrichikpungei hah malngei angin a lei phâm ngei sikin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">Jos 6:22-25</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Jos 2:1-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Ka la misîr sa rang mo? Gideon, Barak, Samson, Jephthah, David, Samuel le dêipungei thurchi misîr rang lakinte keima rangin zora mi hun pe mak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Roi 6:11—8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">4:6—5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">13:2—16:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">11:1—12:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1-2:11">1 Sam 16:1—1 Rêng 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1-25:1">1 Sam 1:1—25:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>An taksônna jârin ram pumpui an doia, an menea. Imo adik, hah an sina male Pathien'n imo chong ânkhâm hah an mana. Ekeibaknei bâikoungei an hîppe ngeia, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Dan 6:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>mei inthangngei an thata, khandaia thata an om rang hah an rotpai ani. Râtloi an lei nia, aniatachu an hong râta; râlbuola râttak an nia ramdang râlmingei an motorsar ngâi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Dan 3:1-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Taksônna jârin nupangngeiin an sûngsuok lei thi ngei inthoia ring nôk an man ani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Adangngei khom hoiriema om nuomloiin, inthoinôkna sa uol an man theina rangin dûktuonga thi rangin an om ani. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Senkhat chu munuoiinja sinnân an manga male an vîk ngeia, Adangngei chu Jîngzirûia thungin intângna ina an khuma. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26">1 Rêng 22:26</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 22:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25">2 Rich 18:25</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 18:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Jer 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Lunga dêngin an oma, bongnika âtin an oma, khandaia thatin an oma. Belri vunngei aninônchu kêl vunngei insilin an invâia inriengin, dûkmintongin le nunuomlôn an oma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2 Rich 24:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>An ta rangin chu rammuol hih ommun hoiloi tak ani! Mi invâingei angin ramchâr ngeia le tângngeia an invâka, lungkuo ngei le khurngeia an om ngâia.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>An taksônnân mangei murdi hah riettitna an mana! Hannoma Pathien chonginkhâm chu man phâk mak ngei. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Pathien'n ei ta rangin manêka neinun mintuo sa uol mindonna a nei sikin. Eini ngei leh vai kêng achukphara sinin an om rang ti hi Pathien neinunkhîn ani.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Pathien ei Pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Eini rangin chu, rietpuipungei mipui tamtak huolin ei om sika hin, mikhap ngâi neinun murdi lampui renga le sietna einia koprap hi ei thenin pai ei ta, ei motona tân insietna a oma hin ranak songin tân ei ti u. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Jisua ei taksônna minngamna phutna le mongna tieng ei mitin enngit ei ti u. Khros sika han mong uol maka! Ama han a motona râisânnân a lei ngâk sika han khros chunga intemtaka a thi rang hah itên mindon maka, male atûn chu Pathien rêngsukmun changtieng a hon sung zoi.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Masikin, nin thenin nin inzala nin mâk loina rangin nunsie ngei esêlna-natak tuongpu lei palna hah mindon roi! <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Sietna nin doina hin thi ngam rak rang dôrin la song mak chei. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5,6: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Job 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11">Chvr 3:11</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 3:12">12</ref> (LXX)</char> </note> Pathien'n a nâingei anga nangni a mohôkna chong ngei hah nin mingil mo zoi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Ka nâipasal, Pumapa nang a mindik lâihan lunghâng thôn la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">male nang a ngo lâi khomin inzal no roh.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Asikchu Pumapa'n a lungkham ngei kai chu a mindik ngâia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">male nâi anga a pomngei kai chu a sepngei ngâi.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Pân sepna anga nangni a mintuong hi dier roi; nin tuongna hin Pathien'n nâingei anga nangni a bena hih ânlang ani. Pa'n a nâingei a sep ngâiloi tu mo a oma? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>A nâingei murdi'n sepna an tong ngâi anga nin tong nôn chu, nâi tatak ngei ni mak cheia, jâinâi kêng nin ni, tina ani. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Ei munisi nina tienga ei pa ngei khom min sep ngâia male ei jâ ngei ngâi ani. Khodôr tak mo, nonte, ei Ratha tienga Pa kôm vangte inpêklûtin ei om rang anâng ni zoi! <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Ei munisi tienga pa ngeiin chu chomolte, asa an ti lam takin min sep ngâia; aniatachu Pathien'n chu ei satna rang le ânthiengna ei chang theina rangin kêng mi sep ngâi. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Sepna ei tuong lâiin chu râisâna ni loiin, khoi mini inngûinân ma zora han chu ei ta rangin ânlang ngâi. Nikhomsenla, nûka chu, ma anga sepna tuonga nunchansôia omngeiin chu rathanngamom ringnun diktak ha râisânman an ât ngâi.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rilna le inningna ngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Nin kut khamngei hah lâng ungla, nin minkhûk ânnîk ngei hah minngîr roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa 35:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Kholrangei hah lôntheiloia an omloina rangin, mindama an om theina rangin lam tûna lôn roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Chvr 4:26</ref> (LXX)</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Mi tiin leh inngêia lêng rang pût ungla, inthiengna dôn rangin pût sa roi, asikchu maha boiin tutên Pumapa mu thei noni ngei. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Tute Pathien moroina renga kîr nôka, thingkung kha hônchera, a tûr sika baiinkhamna tamtak suok anga mi omloi rangin inrung roi. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Bal 29:18</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Tute indit song mi mo nônchu Esau anga ratha mi niloia, om anghan hong om no roi. Ama hah nâipasal ulien nina hah voikhat bunêkna rangin a juor ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Aph 25:29-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Nûka han, a Pa satvurna la chang rang nuomin mitrithi tâkpumin zong khomresea, a sin lei tho hah thûl rangin ite lampui dang reng a man khâiloi sikin hengin aom zoi, ti nin riet.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zong khomresea; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">satvurna man rang a pûta.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Aph 27:30-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Nangni chu nin rietphâk thei Israel mipui ngei hong anghan Sinai Tânga hong nimak cheia, mahan meichuongngei, ijîngngei le sûmdukngei, phâivuopuingei, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18,19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Jôk 19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11">Bal 4:11</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 4:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5:22-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>bekul miring inringtak ngei, le rôl miring ngei a oma. Mipui ngeiin ma rôl hah an riet lâihan, chongbâi dang riet nôk khâiloi rangin an ngêna. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>“Sâ tena luo khom tâng hah a tônin chu lunga dêng that ngêt rang ani,” ti chongpêk hah an tuong theiloi sika ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12">Jôk 19:12</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>An mu hah chi a om sabaka, Moses luon, “Ki chia kên nîknat!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Bal 9:19</ref></char></note> a ti ani.<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Manêkin, nangni chu Zion Tâng, Pathien Ring khopuilien, invân Jerusalem leh vântîrtonngei isâng tamtak ngei omna hong nin ni. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Nangni chu Pathien nâilutîr ngei invâna an riming chuongsai ngei râisâna an intûpna hong nin ni. Mi murdi ngei roijêkpu le misa ngei ratha achukphara sinpu Pathien kôm hong nin ni. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Nangni chu Jisua, chonginkhit thar minsûkpu thisen rethe, Abel thisen nêka neinun sa uol chonginkhâmpu kôm nin hong ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Aph 4:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Hanchu, thurchi misîrpu hah lei rangâi nuomloia nin om loina rangin singthei roi. Tukhom pilchunga pathien thurchi misîrpu lei rangâi nuomloi ngei chu rotpai thei mak ngei. Eini invân renga thurchi misîrpu nûksongngei vang hinte kho angin mo ei rotpai thei ranga!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:22">Jôk 20:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Ma zora han, a rôl han pilchung ânnîka, aniatachu atûn chu, “Voikhat chu pilchung vai niloiin invân khom ka la min nîk sa rang tiin chong ânkhâm ani.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Masikin, “Tûn voikhat” ti chongbâi hin neinun sinngei hah min nîkin thonpai la nîng an ta, neinun ânnîk theiloingei chu om bang an tih, tiin ânthârin a minlang ani.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Hanchu, rêngram innîk theiloi ei man sika hin ei râiminsân ei ti u. Râisânin, a lungdo lamin leh rintak le chipumin Pathien chubaimûk ei ti u; <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>asikchu ei Pathien hi adiktakin mi kângminmang ngâi mei ani.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Inmo Pathien râiminsân rang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Inkhat le inkhat Khristien sungsuokngei anghan inlungkham inlôm roi. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Nin ina khuolmi ngei modôm rang riettit roi. Mi senkhatin ma anghan lei thôn an riet loi kârin vântîrton ngei an lei mintung zoi kêng. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Aph 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Intângna ina omngei hah, nangni khom anni ngei leh ântâng sa anghan riettit roi. Intak tuongngei hah nangni khom nin tuongpui ngei sa anghan riettit roi.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Inneina hi mi murdi'n an minlut rang ania, lômpa ngei le lômnu ngei khomin taksôn omin an om inlôm ngêt rang ani. Inditnasaloi songngei le inrê songngei chu Pathien'n a jêk rang ani.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:6">Bal 31:6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Jos 1:5</ref></char>
    </note> Nin ringnuna han sum miditna inchel no rese, nin dôn chunga han nin mulung minchuk roi. Pathien'n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">“Nang mathân tet no ninga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">nang mâkrak no ning,” a tia.<verse eid="HEB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:6">Lap 118:6</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Masikin hâitakin, “Pumapa chu mi sanpu ani, chi no ning.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Miriemin imo minlo thei ranga?” tîng ei ti u.<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Pathien chong nangni lei misîr pe nin ruoipu masa ngei hah riettit roi. An lei hong omlam le an thitie ngei hah mindon nôk ungla, male an taksôn lam inchu roi. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Jisua Khrista chu majân, avien le kumtuongin aningâiin ani tit. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Minchuna dang ngeiin lampui dik renga nangni tuong minvâi no rese ngei. Pathien moroina renga sûngtienga râtna man hi asa, sâknêk roia balam jômin chu ni no rese; ma balam jômpu ngei han ite asena-om man mak ngei.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Judangei chubaimûkna muna ochai sin tho ngei hah ei mâichâm chunga inbôlna ite sâk rangin racham nei mak ngei. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Juda Ochai Inlaltak han nunsie inbôlna rangin sa thisenngei hah pêk rangin Mun Inthieng Tak sûnga han a lûtpui ngâia; aniatachu sa takpumngei hah chu rubuk pêntieng han an hâl ngâi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Och 16:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Masik taka han, Jisua khomin ama thisen nanâk leh mingei an nunsiena renga a minthieng theina rangin khopuilien pêntieng a thi ani. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Tho, masikin ama kôm khopui pêntieng sêng ei ta a mâimôkna va tuongpui sa rei u. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Pilchunga hin eini rangin khopuilien adet dôn mak me; khopuilien la hong om rang hah ei thîr bang ani. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Tho, Jisua jâra ei inbôlnân Pathien kôm minpâkna pêk tit ei tih u, maha meleingeiin Inbôlna an pêk, Pumapa ani, tia ama an thopna ani. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Asa sin le inkhat le inkhat insan inlôm hi mingil tet no roi, asikchu ma ngei hi inbôlna Pathien râiminsân ngâi an ni.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Nin ruoipungei chong jôm ungla, an chongpêk murdi jûi roi. Pathien kôm an sintho ngâi ngei hah an la misîr ngêt rang sikin inngam loiin nin ratha ngei an enkol ani. An chong nin jômin chu râisân takin an sintho an ta; nin tho nônchu inngûi pumin tho an ta, ninta rangin sa no nih.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Kin ta rangin chubai mi tho pe tit roi. Zora tiin neinun dik sin rang kin nuom tit sikin sielesa rietna inthieng kin dôn, ti kin riet mindik ani. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Nin kôm tieng Pathien'n mi hong tîrlai nôk theina rangin chubai tho rangin nangni ke ngên tatak ani.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khârna chubaithona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20-21"/>Ei Pumapa Jisua, a thina sika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:20-21: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a thina sika; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">a thisen sika.</char></note> kumtuong chonginkhit min deta om, belri ranga Belrihôlpu Roiinpuitak, thina renga a kaithoinôkpu inngêina Pathien han a lungdo nin sin theina rangin neinun sa nin nâng murdi nangni pêk senla, Jisua Khrista jâra ei sûnga hin ama'n a lungdo sin rese. Male Khrista kôm roiinpuina chu kumtuong, kumtuongin om rese! Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:20-21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Azoina chongngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, nin kôma ke lekhamuthuon hi asei bak loi sikin hi mohôkna chongbe ngei; hi lunghâng thôn nin rangâi rangin nangni ke ngên ani. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Ei lâibungpa Timothy hah intângna in renga mojôk ani zoi ti nin riet rangin ku nuom. A hong laiin chu, nangni ko hong mu tena hongtuong ki tih.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Nin ruoipungei murdi le Pathien mingei murdi chibai mi pêk pe roi. Italy renga lâibung le sarnungeiin chibai nangni an hong muthuon.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Pathien moroina chu nin rênga nin kôm om rese.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
